    {
      "example": "score",
      "help_en": "The basis on which you want to sort the query results. Valid values:\n\nvcoreSeconds: the total CPU consumption over time in seconds.\nmemSeconds: the total memory consumption over time in seconds.\nvcoreUtilization: the average CPU utilization. The meaning is the same as the %CPU parameter in the output of the top command in Linux.\nmemUtilization: the average memory usage.\nvcoreSecondsDayGrowthRatio: the day-to-day growth rate of the total CPU consumption over time in seconds.\nmemSecondsDayGrowthRatio: the day-to-day growth rate of the total memory consumption over time in seconds.\nreadSize: the total amount of data read from the file system.\nwriteSize: the total amount of data written to the file system.\nhealthyJobCount: the total number of healthy jobs.\nsubHealthyJobCount: the total number of sub-healthy jobs.\nunhealthyJobCount: the total number of unhealthy jobs.\nneedAttentionJobCount: the total number of jobs that require attention.\nscore: the score for jobs.\nscoreDayGrowthRatio: the day-to-day growth rate of the score for jobs",
      "help_zh": "排序顺序。取值：\nvcoreSeconds：资源CPU使用总量。\nmemSeconds：资源内存使用总量。\nvcoreUtilization：资源平均CPU使用率。同Linux Top的%CPU含义。\nmemUtilization：资源平均内存利用率。\nvcoreSecondsDayGrowthRatio：资源CPU使用总量日环比。\nmemSecondsDayGrowthRatio：资源内存使用总量日环比。\nreadSize：资源读取文件系统总量。\nwriteSize：资源写入文件系统总量。\nhealthyJobCount：健康任务总数。\nsubHealthyJobCount：亚健康任务总数。\nunhealthyJobCount：不健康任务总数。\nneedAttentionJobCount：需要关注的任务总数。\nscore：资源任务评分。\nscoreDayGrowthRatio：资源任务评分日环比",
